{"type":"text","timestamp":1794384205104,"sessionID":"ses_e36692c12ffexRS53PvuzSYVT7","part":{"id":"prt_1c9a21518001ByodHVBPpW5mv6","messageID":"msg_1c9a1863c001nYvplpj6653Yn4","sessionID":"ses_e36692c12ffexRS53PvuzSYVT7","type":"text","text":"Implemented the store finder.\n\n- `backend/app.py`: SQLite under `./data`, first-start seeding of 8 stores, auth (register/login with bearer tokens), admin-only create/replace/delete, search + haversine radius filtering, and frontend serving.\n- `frontend/`: React/TS UI with admin sign-in, searchable store list, geolocation + radius selector, canvas-free SVG plot, and admin add/edit/delete forms showing API validation errors, styled with Tailwind v4.\n- Updated `frontend/package.json`/lock, `vite.config.ts`, `tsconfig.json`, and cleaned `backend/requirements.lock` for constraint-based installs.\n\nVerified builds, API behavior (auth, validation, distance sorting, persistence across restarts, admin-disabled mode), and static frontend serving.","time":{"start":1794384205080,"end":1794384205085}}}
